<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100308" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεπι-σκοποῦμαι</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Gal.
			6.256
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			10.662
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			2.681
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>join in
				examining, examine</i> or <i>consider together with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλά μοι τόδε συνεπίσκεψαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Hp.Ma.</u>
					296b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεπίσκεψαι μετ᾽ ἐμοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cra.</u>
					422c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῶν ἀπορουμένων λόγων
					συνεπισκεψάμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>MM</u>
					1200b22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεπισκοπεῖν καὶ τὰ ὑπ᾽ ἐκείνου
					λεχθέντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					8.3.23
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτα συνεπισκόπει καὶ αὐτός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.83e
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				714c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεπισκέψασθε ᾗ . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ap.</u>
					27a
				</span></i>
			.</div>
